{"id":"627883","name":"槐花馅饺子","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/627883/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"槐花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一把"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"槐树林。","img":"images/627883/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采摘的槐花。","img":"images/627883/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淘洗干净，控水。","img":"images/627883/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"淖一下，捞出。","img":"images/627883/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"挤出多余水分。","img":"images/627883/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"择好的葱，洗净，控水，切碎，备用。","img":"images/627883/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"槐花和葱放入盆中，热油浇一下，加适量盐调味。","img":"images/627883/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/627883/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面醒20分钟，再揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/627883/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搓成长条状。","img":"images/627883/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切成大小均匀的小剂子。","img":"images/627883/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成大小均匀的饺子皮。","img":"images/627883/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/627883/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包好的饺子。","img":"images/627883/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"锅中放适量水,水开后,直接放入饺子，煮沸后加冷水，再煮开后再加冷水，一共加三次冷水,已煮熟的饺子,如图所示。","img":"images/627883/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盛入盘中。","img":"images/627883/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"清香可口。","img":"images/627883/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}